    {
      "id": "2120181680476688744",
      "text": "Agreed, lots to criticize Horst for but 2nd rounders are a crapshoot both in terms of talent and timing. Rare to get legit rotation guys like Mamu and Merrill late in 2nd, but developing them (esp on vet team with expectations) isn’t easy. Sometimes it takes a few stops (Rollins)",
      "url": "https://x.com/fmaddenNBA/status/2120181680476688744",
      "published": "2026-11-10T15:47:58+00:00",
      "likes": 31,
      "author": "Frank Madden",
      "handle": "fmaddenNBA",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1484397622085533699/gkUrv5pP_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "Bucks fans who use Sandro as a reason to shit on Horst. Not a fan of that criticism. He's on his 3rd team post Bucks with another g league stint in between. I'm ok with some Horst criticism. But this ain't one of em. Glad he's found his footing as a decent role player.",
      "quoted_author": "Cream City Crossover",
      "quoted_handle": "TCIIIESQ21"
    },
